 "remarks": "Spectacular custom-built modern home in the heart of Old Greenwich. Flooded with natural light, this sophisticated residence features soaring ceilings, oversized windows, and seamless indoor-outdoor living throughout. The open-concept layout offers effortless flow for both everyday living and entertaining, a gourmet kitchen with an oversized island, a retractable screened porch, and a private office. Four spacious en-suite bedrooms include a beautifully designed primary suite, while the finished walkout lower level adds exceptional flexibility with an additional bedroom and en-suite space. Level yard, patios, and beautifully designed modern living complete this exceptional home. Available early August.",
